[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2100.069, "timestamp": "00:35:00", "text": "非”字段，我該如何添加？所以，它位於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2108.47, "timestamp": "00:35:08", "text": "整個陣列的最底部。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2110.47, "timestamp": "00:35:10", "text": "這看起來似乎可以，但充電或許能幫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2112.069, "timestamp": "00:35:12", "text": "你把一些小東西保存下來，可能就在某個地方。  趕緊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2117.349, "timestamp": "00:35:17", "text": "恐慌吧，老兄。我的天啊，它別"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2120.249, "timestamp": "00:35:20", "text": "死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2141.91, "timestamp": "00:35:41", "text": "應用程式位置結束。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2148.069, "timestamp": "00:35:48", "text": "件事不存在，對吧？是嗎？等等，稍等。  耽誤。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2151.19, "timestamp": "00:35:51", "text": "等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2154.23, "timestamp": "00:35:54", "text": "讓我用這些垃圾檔案中的一個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2156.55, "timestamp": "00:35:56", "text": "是的，我會用這個。等等，這"}]